refactor(functions): address PR #126 review comments — centralized roles, retention collections, sweep PII coverage

- Add functions/src/constants/roles.ts with PROVINCIAL_SUPERADMIN,
  PDRRMO, PRIVILEGED_ROLES, and PRIVILEGED_WITH_PDRRMO constants
- Add functions/src/constants/retention.ts with
  RETENTION_EXEMPT_COLLECTIONS single source of truth
- Update 9 callables to import roles from constants instead of
  hard-coding role strings (prevents future role drift)
- Update set-retention-exempt to derive collection enum from
  RETENTION_EXEMPT_COLLECTIONS constant
- Add contactPhone nulling to erasure-sweep and retention-sweep
  (completes PII cleanup alongside exactLocation)

Addresses Sourcery review comments:
1. Centralize privileged roles to prevent scattered edits and drift
2. Derive retention-exempt collections from shared type
3. Clear all PII fields (including contactPhone) in privacy sweeps